OL,3,GNEWSATears of joy as charity secures
OL,4,A32-year lease
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who runs a charity supporting
OL,7,Fcommunity groups said she cried "tears
OL,8,Fof relief and happiness" when a council
OL,9,Fgranted them a 32-year lease to stay in
OL,10,Fthe building they occupy.
OL,12,FRiverside Community Hub, on Islington
OL,13,FRoad in Towcester, has been run by
OL,14,FSouth Northamptonshire Volunteer Bureau
OL,15,F(SNVB) in the building for three years.
OL,17,FIts future looked uncertain until West
OL,18,FNorthamptonshire Council agreed a long
OL,19,Flease with the charity, enabling it to
OL,20,Fapply for grants and carry out about
OL,21,F#1m of repairs and improvements.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
