OL,3,GNEWSATears of joy as charity secures
OL,4,A32-year lease
OL,5,
OL,6,FHelen Barrett, head of SNVB, said:
OL,7,F"This gives us the opportunity to make
OL,8,Fit a space we're really proud of, and
OL,9,Fbreathe new life into it."
